:1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 5.3%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $523M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 61.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.04"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":33.63,"default_fair_val":33.63,"premium_pct":34.2,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":29.3,"pe_forward":25.8,"pb_trailing":4.1,"pb_forward":3.7,"div_yield":4.75,"ps_ratio":4.8,"fcf_to_ev":3.82,"fcf_to_mcap":5.17,"liab_to_assets":61.3,"cash_to_assets":0.2,"current_ratio":0.04,"roe":14,"roa":5.3,"moat":{"ticker":"CUBE","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 作為領先的自助倉儲品牌，在市場上建立了相當的品牌認知度與客戶忠誠度。其品牌價值使其能夠在一定程度上支持定價能力，尤其是在競爭激烈的市場中，良好的品牌形象有助於吸引和留住客戶。然而，與其他消費品品牌相比，倉儲服務的品牌溢價相對有限，客戶的選擇更多基於便利性和價格。因此，儘管品牌有助於區隔市場，但其定價權的強度屬於中等水平，難以形成顯著的價格領導地位。","comment_en":"CubeSmart, as a leading self-storage brand, has established considerable brand recognition and customer loyalty in the market. Its brand value allows it to support pricing power to a certain extent, especially in competitive markets where a good brand image helps attract and retain customers. However, compared to other consumer goods brands, the brand premium for storage services is relatively limited, with customer choices often based more on convenience and price. Therefore, while the brand helps differentiate the market, the strength of its pricing power is moderate, making it difficult to form a significant price leadership position."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲行業的進入壁壘相對較低，CubeSmart 的業務模式不依賴於專利技術或特許經營權。其營運主要受土地使用、建築規範和地方性法規的影響，這些並非構成獨特的、可持續的競爭優勢。公司無需應對複雜的監管審批流程，也無從利用專利來保護其核心業務。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，CubeSmart 的得分極低，幾乎沒有這方面的護城河可言。","comment_en":"The self-storage industry has relatively low barriers to entry, and CubeSmart's business model does not rely on patented technology or exclusive licenses. Its operations are primarily influenced by land use, building codes, and local regulations, none of which constitute unique, sustainable competitive advantages. The company does not need to navigate complex regulatory approval processes, nor can it leverage patents to protect its core business. Therefore, CubeSmart scores extremely low in terms of patent and regulatory barriers, possessing virtually no moat in this area."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲的轉換成本相對較低。客戶在選擇倉儲服務時，主要考量地點、價格和便利性。一旦找到更合適的選項，搬遷成本（時間和體力）雖然存在，但並不足以構成強大的約束力。CubeSmart 的客戶可能會因為價格、距離或其他服務的改善而轉換到競爭對手。儘管公司努力透過良好的客戶服務和設施來提高客戶黏性，但其轉換成本的壁壘強度僅為中等，難以鎖定客戶長期不變。","comment_en":"The switching costs in self-storage are relatively low. When customers choose storage services, they primarily consider location, price, and convenience. While the cost of moving (time and effort) exists if a more suitable option is found, it is not a strong deterrent. CubeSmart's customers may switch to competitors due to price, proximity, or improvements in other services. Although the company strives to enhance customer stickiness through good customer service and facilities, the barrier strength from switching costs is only moderate, making it difficult to lock in customers indefinitely."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲行業的網絡效應非常有限。CubeSmart 的業務模式並非典型的平台型或社交型，其價值並非隨著用戶數量的增加而顯著提升。雖然公司擁有廣泛的設施網絡，這有助於地理覆蓋和客戶便利性，但這更多是規模優勢而非網絡效應。客戶之間的互動極少，一個客戶的使用體驗不會直接影響到其他客戶的價值。因此，網絡效應在這方面幾乎不存在，無法構成有效的護城河。","comment_en":"Network effects in the self-storage industry are very limited. CubeSmart's business model is not typically platform-based or social; its value does not significantly increase with the number of users. While the company possesses an extensive network of facilities, which aids in geographical coverage and customer convenience, this is more of a scale advantage than a network effect. Customer interactions are minimal, and one customer's usage experience does not directly impact the value for other customers. Therefore, network effects are virtually non-existent in this regard and cannot form an effective moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 作為行業領導者之一，其規模經濟帶來了顯著的成本優勢。公司能夠透過大規模採購、標準化營運流程以及更有效的資本配置來降低單位成本。龐大的物業組合使其在與供應商談判時具有更強的議價能力，並能分散固定成本。這種規模優勢有助於其在價格競爭中保持有利地位，並為進一步擴張提供支持。雖然規模並非絕對壁壘，但在倉儲業中，規模帶來的成本效率是重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"As one of the industry leaders, CubeSmart's economies of scale provide significant cost advantages. The company can reduce unit costs through large-scale procurement, standardized operational processes, and more effective capital allocation. Its extensive property portfolio gives it stronger bargaining power with suppliers and allows for the distribution of fixed costs. This scale advantage helps it maintain a favorable position in price competition and supports further expansion. While scale is not an absolute barrier, the cost efficiencies derived from scale are an important competitive advantage in the storage industry."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 在美國主要都會區擁有廣泛的物業組合，其地理位置的選擇是關鍵的競爭因素。公司專注於人口稠密、需求強勁的地區，這些優質地段的獲取和開發本身就構成了一定的進入壁壘。然而，倉儲業的資產性質使其難以形成真正的「不可複製」性，因為土地和建築始終是可以被模仿或替代的。儘管其現有資產組合在特定區域具有戰略價值，但其獨特性和不可複製性不如某些擁有獨特自然資源或地理位置的企業。","comment_en":"CubeSmart owns an extensive portfolio of properties in major US metropolitan areas, and the selection of its geographical locations is a key competitive factor. The company focuses on densely populated areas with strong demand, and the acquisition and development of these prime locations inherently form certain entry barriers. However, the asset-intensive nature of the storage industry makes it difficult to achieve true 'irreproducibility,' as land and buildings can always be imitated or substituted. While its existing asset portfolio holds strategic value in specific regions, its uniqueness and irreproducibility are less pronounced than in companies possessing unique natural resources or geographical positions."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 在營運效率方面表現出色，展現了其作為成熟 REIT 的管理能力。公司透過標準化流程、技術應用（如線上預訂和管理系統）以及對設施維護的嚴格控制，實現了較高的資產利用率和較低的營運成本。其 F-Score 為 6/9，顯示其財務健康狀況良好。持續的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $523.3M）證明了其營運的穩健性和盈利能力。這種卓越的營運效率是其能夠在競爭中保持優勢的重要因素。","comment_en":"CubeSmart excels in operational efficiency, demonstrating its management capabilities as a mature REIT. The company achieves high asset utilization and low operating costs through standardized processes, technology applications (such as online booking and management systems), and strict control over facility maintenance. Its F-Score of 6/9 indicates good financial health. Consistent free cash flow (FCF TTM: $523.3M) attests to the robustness and profitability of its operations. This superior operational efficiency is a crucial factor enabling it to maintain a competitive edge."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 作為一家 REIT，其資本配置策略對於維持和增長至關重要。公司在收購、開發新物業以及維護現有資產之間取得平衡。其 ROE 14.0% 和 ROA 5.3% 表明其資本配置能夠產生穩健的回報。儘管其現金儲備相對負債較少，但其持續的自由現金流為其提供了再投資和償還債務的靈活性。管理層在擴張和維持資產價值方面展現了相對審慎和有效的資本配置能力。","comment_en":"As a REIT, CubeSmart's capital allocation strategy is crucial for maintenance and growth. The company balances acquisitions, development of new properties, and maintenance of existing assets. Its ROE of 14.0% and ROA of 5.3% indicate that its capital allocation generates solid returns. Although its cash reserves are relatively low compared to its debt, its consistent free cash flow provides flexibility for reinvestment and debt repayment. Management has demonstrated a relatively prudent and effective capital allocation capability in terms of expansion and maintaining asset value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"CubeSmart 的客戶保留率受到其品牌聲譽、設施品質和客戶服務的影響。雖然轉換成本不高，但公司透過提供乾淨、安全、便利的倉儲環境，以及易於使用的線上平台，努力提高客戶滿意度和忠誠度。其相對穩定的客戶基礎和經常性收入模式是其業務模式的體現。然而，由於行業競爭激烈，客戶流動性依然存在，因此客戶保留的壁壘強度屬於中等。","comment_en":"CubeSmart's customer retention rate is influenced by its brand reputation, facility quality, and customer service. Although switching costs are not high, the company strives to enhance customer satisfaction and loyalty by providing clean, secure, and convenient storage environments, along with an easy-to-use online platform. Its relatively stable customer base and recurring revenue model are reflections of its business model. However, due to intense industry competition, customer churn still exists, making the barrier strength for customer retention moderate."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲行業具有一定的週期韌性，尤其是在經濟波動時期，人們可能需要儲存更多物品。CubeSmart 作為行業領導者，其多元化的地理佈局和穩定的經常性收入模式，使其能夠在不同經濟環境下保持相對穩定的表現。其資產（倉儲設施）具有較長的經濟壽命，且維護成本相對可控。儘管面臨競爭和潛在的經濟衰退風險，但其業務模式的持久性較強，能夠抵禦一定程度的衝擊。","comment_en":"The self-storage industry possesses a certain degree of cyclical resilience, especially during economic downturns when people may need to store more belongings. As an industry leader, CubeSmart's diversified geographical presence and stable recurring revenue model enable it to maintain relatively stable performance across different economic environments. Its assets (storage facilities) have long economic lives, and maintenance costs are relatively manageable. Despite facing competition and potential economic recession risks, its business model exhibits strong durability and can withstand a certain level of impact."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"CubeSmart 的經濟護城河主要體現在其規模優勢（M5）和卓越的營運效率（M7）上，這使其能夠在競爭激烈的自助倉儲市場中保持成本競爭力並提供可靠的服務。其品牌（M1）和地理位置（M6）也提供了一定的區隔作用，但並非難以逾越的壁壘。該公司缺乏專利或網絡效應（M2, M4），且轉換成本（M3）和客戶保留（M9）強度中等。整體而言，CubeSmart 屬於一種「收費橋」或「商品型」業務模式，依賴於高效的運營和規模來獲取穩定現金流，其護城河相對堅固但非無懈可擊。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"CubeSmart's economic moat is primarily reflected in its economies of scale (M5) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), enabling it to maintain cost competitiveness and provide reliable services in the highly competitive self-storage market. Its brand (M1) and geographical locations (M6) also offer some differentiation, but they do not represent insurmountable barriers. The company lacks patents or network effects (M2, M4), and the strength of switching costs (M3) and customer retention (M9) is moderate. Overall, CubeSmart operates a 'toll bridge' or 'commodity-like' business model, relying on efficient operations and scale to generate stable cash flows. Its moat is relatively robust but not impregnable.","evidenceHash":"d859e2f6d0d88e113e8bbcca3f416ad1e701e67b8b6b4e8c444aea6732d535d0","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"d859e2f6d0d88e113e8bbcca3f416ad1e701e67b8b6b4e8c444aea6732d535d0","currentEvidenceHash":"d859e2f6d0d88e113e8bbcca3f416ad1e701e67b8b6b4e8c444aea6732d535d0"},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:11:44.655Z","evidenceHash":"96128404cdffe439a60154bfd4b7cb843e900b57f3639ab8d710b73e7cbab8b1"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:11:44.655Z","evidenceHash":"96128404cdffe439a60154bfd4b7cb843e900b57f3639ab8d710b73e7cbab8b1"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CUBE.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/CUBE.png","website":"https://www.cubesmart.com","ceo":"Christopher Marr","full_time_employees":"3121","description":"CubeSmart functions as an independent real estate investment trust (REIT), overseeing both its administration and management. The company's self-storage facilities deliver secure, convenient, and budget-friendly storage options for both private individuals and commercial entities. According to data from the 2020 Self-Storage Almanac, CubeSmart ranks among the top three owners and operators of self-storage properties nationwide.","description_en":"CubeSmart functions as an independent real estate investment trust (REIT), overseeing both its administration and management. The company's self-storage facilities deliver secure, convenient, and budget-friendly storage options for both private individuals and commercial entities. According to data from the 2020 Self-Storage Almanac, CubeSmart ranks among the top three owners and operators of self-storage properties nationwide.","description_zh":"CubeSmart（美股代碼：CUBE）為 Real Estate 領域之重要企業，專注於 REIT - Industrial 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"5 Old Lancaster Road","city":"Malvern","state":"PA","zip":"19355-2132","country":"US","phone":"610-535-5000","full_address":"5 Old Lancaster Road, Malvern, PA 19355-2132, US","range_52w":"35.09-46.41","year_high":46.41,"year_low":35.09,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":35.09,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"MARTIN TIMOTHY M","title":"officer: CFO","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":36765,"price":26.3,"total_val":0.97},{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"MARTIN TIMOTHY M","title":"officer: CFO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":36765,"price":43.51,"total_val":1.6},{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"MARTIN TIMOTHY M","title":"officer: CFO","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":36765,"price":26.3,"total_val":0.97},{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"Foster Jeffrey P","title":"officer: CLO & Secretary","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":227